# Workflow Rules

- Work in phases.
- Do not implement the whole product in one step.
- Start with mock data and end-to-end UI flow.
- After each phase, ensure the app runs locally.
- Prefer incremental, reviewable changes.
- When creating or editing files, keep the project structure from `PROJECT.md`.
- Before adding real external APIs, ensure mock source adapter works.
- Before adding AI synthesis, ensure paper normalization, deduplication, and scoring work.
- Before polishing UI, ensure source-grounding validation works.
- Do not add authentication, payments, or PDF parsing unless explicitly requested.
